        "created_at": "2013-10-14T05:02:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can see arguments for individual counting or always counting from the start of round, but I definately feel like they&nbsp;shouldn't be automatically destroyed as they enter play.&nbsp; If the same logic were applied to Rooftop Combat it would frequently be destroyed as soon as it is played.</p>",
